                                "sense_id": "ddf0ed8c-cfd9-3ec5-bb39-45e5156b8202",
                                "text": "President Joe Biden sent a heartfelt letter to ESPN “College GameDay” football analyst Kirk Herbstreit after his adored golden retriever, Ben, died of cancer last month."
                            }
                        ]
